#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:5
#: 0d2898090e4d4c689fe30cb8993a5f51
msgid "Tuning Speed and Throttle"
msgstr "速度与油门调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:7
#: 0d6bd5ed8435462d9e82076ba3b21e32
msgid ""
"This page describes how a Rover's speed and throttle controls can be tuned. "
"In general it is best to tune this controller before moving on to the "
"steering controllers."
msgstr "本页介绍如何调节 Rover 的速度与油门控制。一般建议先调节此控制器，再调节转向控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:14
#: cd982b48a33c4b00b7affb2750e29dcf
msgid "Controller Diagram"
msgstr "控制器框图"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:18
#: 44ebda4132bb4c07819a6773892984cd
msgid "Cruise Throttle and Cruise Speed (Throttle Baseline)"
msgstr "巡航油门与巡航速度（油门基准）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:20
#: 7d3ef908d86e4763b292c7985d4f9411
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` parameters set the baseline throttle output used by the "
"Desired-Speed-to-Throttle controller.  It is important that these two values"
" are reasonable and consistent with each other meaning that the "
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` value (expressed as a percentage) "
"should be close to the throttle required to achieve the :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` (expressed in m/s)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` 参数设定目标速度至油门控制器所使用的基准油门输出。这两个值必须合理且相互一致，即 "
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` （百分比）应接近达到 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` （m/s）所需的油门值。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:22
#: 35e72d679e5b45f78d912356670b9d80
msgid "The easiest way to set these parameters is to:"
msgstr "设置这些参数最简便的方法是："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:24
#: c5eb417909c34dfaa25c22b5417ecd88
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` to "
"\"Learn Cruise Speed\""
msgstr "将 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 设为「学习巡航速度」"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:25
#: e62f055ef137451690f25a09551c6a6c
msgid "Arm the vehicle and switch to :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`"
msgstr "解锁车辆并切换至 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:26
#: 8e81b35b25114a10a24c8d529b0e5d95
msgid "Drive the vehicle at between 50% and 80% throttle"
msgstr "以 50% 至 80% 油门驾驶车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:27
#: f008b99ab0ae4bf4ad31aff26e80cc0c
msgid ""
"Move the aux function switch to the high position for a few seconds and then"
" back down to the low position"
msgstr "将辅助功能开关拨至高位保持数秒，然后拨回低位"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:28
#: 0f1c97d1b9a84e36b92e4764f93863bd
msgid ""
"Check the ground station for a message like, \"Cruise Learned: Thr:XX "
"Speed:YY\" which confirms :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` and "
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` have been updated"
msgstr ""
"在地面站查看类似「Cruise Learned: Thr:XX Speed:YY」的消息，确认 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 已更新"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:31
#: d05f024590894c88a93ea2797ca375b8
msgid "Desired Speed to Throttle PID Tuning"
msgstr "目标速度至油门 PID 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:33
#: e0bc8bbba7e94befa33a12bef8c56cb7
msgid ""
"The Desired-Speed-to-Throttle controller attempts to achieve the desired "
"speed (set by the pilot or autopilot) using a PID controller.  All modes "
"except :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` and :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` use this "
"controller."
msgstr ""
"目标速度至油门控制器使用 PID 控制器来实现飞手或飞控设定的目标速度。除 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 和 :ref:`Manual"
" <manual-mode>` 外，所有模式均使用此控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:35
#: b13efaae590f4f60839d8cfdf72e3088
msgid ""
"The P, I and D gains for this controller are held in :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P "
"<ATC_SPEED_P>`, :ref:`ATC_SPEED_I <ATC_SPEED_I>` and :ref:`ATC_SPEED_D "
"<ATC_SPEED_D>` parameters respectively.  :ref:`ATC_SPEED_FF <ATC_SPEED_FF>` "
"should be left at zero."
msgstr ""
"该控制器的 P、I 和 D 增益分别存储在 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>`、:ref:`ATC_SPEED_I "
"<ATC_SPEED_I>` 和 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_D <ATC_SPEED_D>` 参数中。:ref:`ATC_SPEED_FF "
"<ATC_SPEED_FF>` 应保留为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:37
#: 8513e241a1a64de6aff9516f0dae43f0
msgid "Recommended steps for tuning this controller are:"
msgstr "调参推荐步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:39
#: 9d721726e4cf4a108319468929f8ec30
msgid "Connect the ground station to the vehicle using a telemetry radio"
msgstr "通过数传电台将地面站与车辆连接"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:40
#: cf68c02ed6ba466eb892dfcf31622b8d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` to 2 (Throttle) to send PID "
"information to the ground station"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` 设为 2（油门）以向地面站发送 PID 信息"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:41
#: 8a475484e5b2412da4a5585fa4d78b8e
msgid ""
"On the ground station graph the \"piddesired\" and \"pidachieved\" values.  "
"If using Mission Planner, Open the Flight Data screen, check the \"Tuning\" "
"checkbox (bottom middle), double click on the graph and select "
"\"pidachieved\", \"piddesired\""
msgstr ""
"在地面站绘制「piddesired」和「pidachieved」数值图表。若使用 Mission "
"Planner，打开飞行数据界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框（底部中间），双击图表并选择「pidachieved」、「piddesired」"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:46
#: d9c732ee370e4bf39d71be0671503a38
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle at various speeds in Acro mode and compare how well "
"pidachieved follows piddesired"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式下以不同速度驾驶车辆，比较 pidachieved 对 piddesired 的跟随效果"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:47
#: 2492482c0b3b4e23ba93f18212ce56a2
msgid ""
"Adjust :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>`, :ref:`ATC_SPEED_I <ATC_SPEED_I>` up"
" or down so that piddesired follows pidachieved"
msgstr ""
"上调或下调 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>`、:ref:`ATC_SPEED_I <ATC_SPEED_I>`，使 "
"piddesired 跟随 pidachieved"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:48
#: eefccd66e128497b8af606e9b9c80ee2
msgid ""
"The :ref:`P gain <ATC_SPEED_P>` is the most important and should be tuned "
"first.  If the vehicle's speed is jerky and unstable then this parameter "
"should be reduced.  If the vehicle is slow to get up to speed, this "
"parameter should be increased."
msgstr ""
":ref:`P 增益 <ATC_SPEED_P>` 最为重要，应首先调节。若车辆速度不稳定或抖动，应减小该参数；若车辆加速缓慢，应增大该参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:49
#: 24e2fe33ffe34fd09406c3b9eebc92f0
msgid ""
"The :ref:`I gain <ATC_SPEED_I>` corrects for long-term error.  If the "
"vehicle never achieves the desired speed, then this parameter should be "
"increased.  If the vehicle's speed is slowly oscillating between too fast "
"and too slow, this parameter should be reduced.  I should normally be lower "
"than P."
msgstr ""
":ref:`I 增益 <ATC_SPEED_I>` "
"修正长期误差。若车辆始终无法达到目标速度，应增大该参数；若车辆速度在过快和过慢之间缓慢振荡，应减小该参数。I 通常应低于 P。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:50
#: c6ac95a2c87649d3b10d965145288911
msgid ""
"The :ref:`D gain <ATC_SPEED_D>` is meant to stablize the output by fighting "
"against short-term changes in speed.  This can be left at zero."
msgstr ":ref:`D 增益 <ATC_SPEED_D>` 用于通过抑制速度的短期变化来稳定输出，可保留为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:51
#: 38b6f93e01d144f0a7e810c3101e4e51
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FF gain <ATC_SPEED_FF>` should be left at zero because the "
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` are used to calculate a base throttle output which removes "
"the need for feed-forward."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FF 增益 <ATC_SPEED_FF>` 应保留为零，因为 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` 已用于计算基准油门输出，无需前馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:54
#: 1adaa8afd54648bab80c104d9a75b157
msgid "Acceleration Limit"
msgstr "加速度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:56
#: c8ec3b3c58e945229dc31199e356affc
msgid ""
"Although less important than other tuning values, the :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX <ATC_DECEL_MAX>` parameters should "
"be set to match the vehicle's physical limits.  This helps the speed "
"controller avoid attempting impossible accelerations and reduces overshoot."
msgstr ""
"虽然不如其他调参值重要，但 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_MAX>` 和 :ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX "
"<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` 参数应设置为与车辆物理极限相匹配。这有助于速度控制器避免尝试不可能的加速，减少超调。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:58
#: 806f4d5c401f493686fc80545862dd5b
msgid ""
"Use the ground station to view the forward-back (aka x-axis) accelerations "
"in real-time.  If using Mission Planner open the Flight Data screen, check "
"the \"Tuning\" checkbox (bottom middle), double click on the graph and "
"select \"ax\". Note that the values are in cm/s/s so they should be divided "
"by 100 to get m/s/s."
msgstr ""
"使用地面站实时查看前后（即 x 轴）加速度。若使用 Mission "
"Planner，打开飞行数据界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框（底部中间），双击图表并选择「ax」。注意数值单位为 cm/s/s，需除以 100 换算为 "
"m/s/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:63
#: 7f336424f04746699e494d5e6b5209dd
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Manual mode, apply full throttle to accelerate from "
"stopped to full speed"
msgstr "在 Manual 模式下驾驶车辆，施加满油门使车辆从静止加速至全速"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:64
#: 1aa320f6fa694ec8acb8e4bf427fa60b
msgid ""
"Use the displayed accelerations as a guide to set the :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX <ATC_DECEL_MAX>` parameters.  Note "
"that the values displayed may be in cm/s/s while the parameter is in m/s/s."
"  If the vehicles acceleration and deceleration are similar "
":ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX <ATC_DECEL_MAX>` can be left as zero"
msgstr ""
"参考显示的加速度数据设置 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_MAX>` 和 :ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX "
"<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` 参数。注意显示值可能为 cm/s/s，而参数单位为 "
"m/s/s。若车辆加速和减速相近，:ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX <ATC_DECEL_MAX>` 可保留为零"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:65
#: ec5b2206c6c6462d9866932f0eb1c1d3
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Acro mode to test the vehicle's accelerations are "
"smooth and that decelerations are not too laggy"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式下驾驶车辆，测试加速是否平顺，减速是否无过多滞后"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:68
#: 9abdd3532e924fe6ba1b7ae3ebe5cc4c
msgid "Throttle Slew"
msgstr "油门变化率限制"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:70
#: 63cc279f7c124ae78f66a2442ea1cff2
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MOT_SLEWRATE <MOT_SLEWRATE>` parameter can be used to limit how "
"quickly the throttle output can change."
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SLEWRATE <MOT_SLEWRATE>` 参数可用于限制油门输出的变化速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:72
#: 22593532c7b7461d8cfc0b23128851c3
msgid ""
"a value of 100 allows the throttle output to change over its full range in "
"one second"
msgstr "值为 100 时，油门输出可在一秒内完成全范围变化"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:73
#: 1bf2dd396ae848c0904647a99a5d0928
msgid "a value of zero disables the limit"
msgstr "值为零时禁用该限制"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed.rst:76
#: 793e78a4dfb94ebb841a39d2fd24794f
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"
